DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261107
SUMMARY:Oracle Fusion 26D: test environments update\, Cohort A (typical dat
 e)
DESCRIPTION:Typical date\, not an Oracle-published date for your environmen
 t. Oracle's published rule: test environments update on the first Friday o
 f the update month and production on the third Friday (Middle East regions
 : the Thursday before). Confirm your own dates in the Oracle Cloud Console
 . Source: https://blogs.oracle.com/fusioninsider/quarterly-updates-made-ea
 sy\n\nTwo-week test window until the production update.\n\nPlain-English b
 riefing: https://fusionupdates.com/26d/
URL:https://fusionupdates.com/26d/
